      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Sort the array first, fix the largest side (right pointer), use two pointers for smaller sides\n- If nums[left] + nums[mid] > nums[right], all pairs (left to mid) work\n- Move pointers : if valid, count and move mid--, else move left++",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Sort the array first, fix the largest side (right pointer), use two pointers for smaller sides\n- If nums[left] + nums[mid] > nums[right], all pairs (left to mid) work\n- Move pointers : if valid, count and move mid--, else move left++",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
