      "text": "- Sort array first, fix two smaller sides (i, j), find largest valid third side using binary search\n- For fixed i & j, find largest k where nums[i] + nums[j] > nums[k]\n - Count all valid k values from j+1 to found position",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Sort array first, fix two smaller sides (i, j), find largest valid third side using binary search\n- For fixed i & j, find largest k where nums[i] + nums[j] > nums[k]\n - Count all valid k values from j+1 to found position",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
