      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Three pointers : left for 0s, curr for 1s and right for 2s\n- if 0 swap with left and advance curr & left, if 1 advance curr, if 2 swap with right and decrement right\n- Continue until curr > right, partitioning the array into 0s, 1s and 2s",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Three pointers : left for 0s, curr for 1s and right for 2s\n- if 0 swap with left and advance curr & left, if 1 advance curr, if 2 swap with right and decrement right\n- Continue until curr > right, partitioning the array into 0s, 1s and 2s",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
