      "updated": 1761702997386,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Use two pointers from both ends moving towards center\n- Track max heights seen so far from both sides\n- Process the side with smaller max height (greedy choice)\n- Key insight : we only need to know the minimum of leftmax and rightmax",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Use two pointers from both ends moving towards center\n- Track max heights seen so far from both sides\n- Process the side with smaller max height (greedy choice)\n- Key insight : we only need to know the minimum of leftmax and rightmax",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
