      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5.1 Should ensure shortened urls are unique, how ??",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5.1 Should ensure shortened urls are unique, how ??",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vN2TZF48vI9m_KerbJwMv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5843.675130182552,
      "y": -1831.837126308781,
      "width": 659.7113647460938,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "IQSW860ywbLS4hT70SALK"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 561940713,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 670955431,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1754787323694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Constraints : unique short codes, keep it as short as possible, efficient generation",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Constraints : unique short codes, keep it as short as possible, efficient generation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GT98tH1s7VGZjoSpChshc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6886.061302017114,
      "y": -1366.3839849730607,
      "width": 991.7594604492188,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "IQSW860ywbLS4hT70SALK"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1289804935,
      "version": 512,
      "versionNonce": 322237095,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1754787323694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- should we worry about length of short code as counter increase ??, \nno even for 1B counter value -> base62 code will be 6 chars. 62^7 (~ 3.5 trillion) URLs , 7-char code.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- should we worry about length of short code as counter increase ??, \nno even for 1B counter value -> base62 code will be 6 chars. 62^7 (~ 3.5 trillion) URLs , 7-char code.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
