    },
    {
      "id": "9qnM4G7kvqWHVP_eEKQco",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5884.39824911023,
      "y": 1061.4416809999566,
      "width": 1330.51904296875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "IQSW860ywbLS4hT70SALK"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 789081095,
      "version": 718,
      "versionNonce": 819911975,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1754787323694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Roughly our database size now : short_url_code (8 bytes),\noriginal_url (100 bytes), created_time (8 bytes), custom_alias (100 bytes),\nexpiration_date (8 bytes) ~ 200+ bytes per row + some user metadat ~ 500 bytes\n- 1 B mappings -> 500 bytes * 1B rows = 500 GB\n- In reality single database easily handles this, even if we hit limit we can shard data across multiple servers (which rarely happens)\n- Given its read heavy (cache handles) and for writes lets say 100k new urls created every day ~ 1 write/sec -> postgres easily handles\n\nWhat if DB goes down ?? ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Roughly our database size now : short_url_code (8 bytes),\noriginal_url (100 bytes), created_time (8 bytes), custom_alias (100 bytes),\nexpiration_date (8 bytes) ~ 200+ bytes per row + some user metadat ~ 500 bytes\n- 1 B mappings -> 500 bytes * 1B rows = 500 GB\n- In reality single database easily handles this, even if we hit limit we can shard data across multiple servers (which rarely happens)\n- Given its read heavy (cache handles) and for writes lets say 100k new urls created every day ~ 1 write/sec -> postgres easily handles\n\nWhat if DB goes down ?? ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
