      "version": 427,
      "versionNonce": 1456938529,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761702997386,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- As urls increase, chance of collision increase\n    (Birthday problem)\n- To avoid, need high entropy -> which means longer\n    short codes -> which is against our constraints\n- Detecting and resolving collision too many database\nlookups adding more latency. -> Ultimately leading to \ntradeoff between uniqueness, length and efficiency.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- As urls increase, chance of collision increase\n    (Birthday problem)\n- To avoid, need high entropy -> which means longer\n    short codes -> which is against our constraints\n- Detecting and resolving collision too many database\nlookups adding more latency. -> Ultimately leading to \ntradeoff between uniqueness, length and efficiency.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
