      "text": "- short url domain served through CDN with\nPoints of Presence (PoPs) geographically \ndistributed around the world\n- By deploying the redirect logic to edge using \nlike cloudflare workers or AWS Lambda@Edge, \nredirection can happen without touching our origin\nserver",
