      "updated": 1761702997386,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- solely relying on disk-based access, poses \nchallenges\n- Typical ssd can handle 100,000 IOPS\n- For Our 100M DAU -> assuming 5 redirects per day\n100, 000, 000 * 5 = 500,000, 000 redirects / day\n500, 000, 000 / 86,400 seconds ~ 5k+ redirects / sec",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- solely relying on disk-based access, poses \nchallenges\n- Typical ssd can handle 100,000 IOPS\n- For Our 100M DAU -> assuming 5 redirects per day\n100, 000, 000 * 5 = 500,000, 000 redirects / day\n500, 000, 000 / 86,400 seconds ~ 5k+ redirects / sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
