    {
      "id": "8Z9mjFUcyUJJhakFYbedq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11516.967165640544,
      "y": 1506.9779708420388,
      "width": 545.5992431640625,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1344813353,
      "version": 363,
      "versionNonce": 360572903,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1754916152213,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Monitor local folder for changes\n    - MACOS : FSEvents\n    - Windows : FileSystemWatcher\n2. If change detected locally, queues modified file for upload\n    locally\n3. Then use upload API to update remote server\n4. Conflicts strategy - last write wins (or versioning)\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Monitor local folder for changes\n    - MACOS : FSEvents\n    - Windows : FileSystemWatcher\n2. If change detected locally, queues modified file for upload\n    locally\n3. Then use upload API to update remote server\n4. Conflicts strategy - last write wins (or versioning)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
