      "text": "5.2 HOW to make uploads, downloads and syncing fast ??",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5.2 HOW to make uploads, downloads and syncing fast ??",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kmIOdQicslZhGEPQ-y6NI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11443.782356845233,
      "y": 5570.941277417165,
      "width": 589.5991821289062,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 321145212,
      "version": 437,
      "versionNonce": 1513575548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755268527451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- For syncing, identify chunks which changed and only sync them\n- Compression - compress file on client before sending to server \n                decompress on server after uploaded and vice versa.\n- For images no, but for text files or pdfs yes.\n- Algos - Gzip, Brotli and Zstandard.\n- Compress before encrypting for much higher compression ratio",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- For syncing, identify chunks which changed and only sync them\n- Compression - compress file on client before sending to server \n                decompress on server after uploaded and vice versa.\n- For images no, but for text files or pdfs yes.\n- Algos - Gzip, Brotli and Zstandard.\n- Compress before encrypting for much higher compression ratio",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
