      "seed": 1981088635,
      "version": 825,
      "versionNonce": 1919687445,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755325963453,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional :\n- Query availability of items by geography (in 1 hour ETA)\n- Order multiple items at the same time\n- Payments/Purchases (OS)\n- Driver routing (OS)\n- Search and Catalog APIs (OS)\n- Cancellations, returns and refunds (OS)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional :\n- Query availability of items by geography (in 1 hour ETA)\n- Order multiple items at the same time\n- Payments/Purchases (OS)\n- Driver routing (OS)\n- Search and Catalog APIs (OS)\n- Cancellations, returns and refunds (OS)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1zXxkycR5yjsyz3OXYyQ1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15088.465541266438,
