      "updated": 1755326198801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional :\n- Can connect to any DS within 1 hour\n- Latency (100ms) for availability\n- Ordering should be consistent\n- Support 10k DS and 100k items in catalog\n- Order volume O(10m/day)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- Can connect to any DS within 1 hour\n- Latency (100ms) for availability\n- Ordering should be consistent\n- Support 10k DS and 100k items in catalog\n- Order volume O(10m/day)",
