      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755328646278,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- What iff order is created and service crashes, we can't deduct\ninventory and subsequent user might order inventor ??\n- Deadlock - two orders having overlapping inventory\n    - user1 and user2 are buying item1 and item2, user1 has lock\n      for item1 and user2 has lock for item2",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- What iff order is created and service crashes, we can't deduct\ninventory and subsequent user might order inventor ??\n- Deadlock - two orders having overlapping inventory\n    - user1 and user2 are buying item1 and item2, user1 has lock\n      for item1 and user2 has lock for item2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
