      ],
      "updated": 1755332127390,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    - We have 10 m orders per day -> Assuming 10 queries per each user per day\n    - 10,000,000 / 100,000 * 10 -> 1000 Queries / Second -> also assuming only 5% buy\n    - 1000 / 0.05 -> 20k queries/second ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    - We have 10 m orders per day -> Assuming 10 queries per each user per day\n    - 10,000,000 / 100,000 * 10 -> 1000 Queries / Second -> also assuming only 5% buy\n    - 1000 / 0.05 -> 20k queries/second ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
