      "updated": 1755394590747,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We will add offset-based pagination to our endpoint /feed?region=Asia&limit=20&page=1\n- Response now includes additional pagination details like (total_pages, current_page)\n- As user scrolls and reaches end of current content: /feed?region=Asia&limit=20&page=2\n    - offset : (page-1) * limit -> calculated by feed service and repeats...",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We will add offset-based pagination to our endpoint /feed?region=Asia&limit=20&page=1\n- Response now includes additional pagination details like (total_pages, current_page)\n- As user scrolls and reaches end of current content: /feed?region=Asia&limit=20&page=2\n    - offset : (page-1) * limit -> calculated by feed service and repeats...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
