      "updated": 1755402242142,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Currently with offset pagination we have issue when new articles are constantly being published.\n    Ex: Assume user is on page 2 -> new articles get added to top of feed and content shifts down\n        When user requests page 3, user might see duplicate articles or miss content entirely.\n        How to fix this ?? ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Currently with offset pagination we have issue when new articles are constantly being published.\n    Ex: Assume user is on page 2 -> new articles get added to top of feed and content shifts down\n        When user requests page 3, user might see duplicate articles or miss content entirely.\n        How to fix this ?? ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
