      "updated": 1755402828720,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We return cursor (representing\ntimestamp) of last article in \nresponse.\n- For subsequent request, client \nincludes this, ex : \n- index on published_at\n\nWHERE published_at < cursor_timestamp\nORDER BY published_at DESC LIMIT 20.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We return cursor (representing\ntimestamp) of last article in \nresponse.\n- For subsequent request, client \nincludes this, ex : \n- index on published_at\n\nWHERE published_at < cursor_timestamp\nORDER BY published_at DESC LIMIT 20.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
