      "text": "- Use time ordered\nUUIDs (like ULIDs) or\ndatabase auto-increment IDs\n\n- Query : \nWHERE article_id < cursor_id\nORDER BY article_id DESC LIMIT\n20.\n- ULIDs (Universally Unique\nLexicographically Sortable\nIdentifiers)",
