      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755406697911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- cache miss still require expensive database queries\n- TTL of 30 minutes shows stale content for users up to 30 minutes\n- Cache expiry triggers a thundering herd—users simultaneously hit the DB \nwith costly queries—overwhelming it and causing minutes-long, \ninconsistent performance until caches repopulate.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- cache miss still require expensive database queries\n- TTL of 30 minutes shows stale content for users up to 30 minutes\n- Cache expiry triggers a thundering herd—users simultaneously hit the DB \nwith costly queries—overwhelming it and causing minutes-long, \ninconsistent performance until caches repopulate.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
