      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Without TTL, cap each regional feed to the latest N (~1–2k) articles—\n  ZADD on insert then ZREMRANGEBYRANK to trim oldest—preventing \n  unbounded growth.\n",
