      "originalText": "- Add a category column and filter \nfeeds by region+category in real time.\n- Support /feed?region=US&category=sports; \nquery `WHERE region=? AND category=? \nORDER BY published_at DESC LIMIT 20` \nwith composite index \n(region, category, published_at).\n",
