      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- significant database performance issue\nat scale for each category especially during\npeak requests\n- caching each category becomes hectic, lets\nsay 25 categories across 10 regions -> 250\ndifferent cache keys (becomes hard to invalidate\nand other ops) \n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- significant database performance issue\nat scale for each category especially during\npeak requests\n- caching each category becomes hectic, lets\nsay 25 categories across 10 regions -> 250\ndifferent cache keys (becomes hard to invalidate\nand other ops) \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
