      "updated": 1755418072661,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- maintain separate sorted sets\nlike feed:Sports:India, feed:Politics:US\nand feed:technology:Sweden and so on...\n- /feed?region=China&category=sports&limit=20\n-> ZREVRANGE feed:Sports:China 0 19",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- maintain separate sorted sets\nlike feed:Sports:India, feed:Politics:US\nand feed:technology:Sweden and so on...\n- /feed?region=China&category=sports&limit=20\n-> ZREVRANGE feed:Sports:China 0 19",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
