      "updated": 1755418243689,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Memory: 250+ ZSETs (25×10) × ~1–2k articles each \n→ much higher Redis footprint.\n- Invalidation/Perf: Cross-key cleanup (articles in multiple feeds) \nadds complexity and, under high publish rates, \nhurts read latency. \n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Memory: 250+ ZSETs (25×10) × ~1–2k articles each \n→ much higher Redis footprint.\n- Invalidation/Perf: Cross-key cleanup (articles in multiple feeds) \nadds complexity and, under high publish rates, \nhurts read latency. \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
