      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755418525213,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Simply, we can include whole\nof article metadata as value against\neach region key\nex: feed:Monaco -> {\n  \"id\": \"123\",\n  \"title\": \"Monaco Grand Prix 2025\",\n  \"description\": \"Will Mercedes Bounce Back??\",\n  \"url\": \"https://f1.com/xyz\",\n  \"category\": \"sports\",\n  \"region\": \"Monaco\",\n  \"published_at\": \"2025-10-21T22:30:00Z\"\n}\n- Do in memory filtering based on category\nand return filtered results",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Simply, we can include whole\nof article metadata as value against\neach region key\nex: feed:Monaco -> {\n  \"id\": \"123\",\n  \"title\": \"Monaco Grand Prix 2025\",\n  \"description\": \"Will Mercedes Bounce Back??\",\n  \"url\": \"https://f1.com/xyz\",\n  \"category\": \"sports\",\n  \"region\": \"Monaco\",\n  \"published_at\": \"2025-10-21T22:30:00Z\"\n}\n- Do in memory filtering based on category\nand return filtered results",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
