      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- availability for searching & viewing events, consistency for booking events (no double booking)\n- Handle popular events\n- latency to search (< 500ms)\n- Read >> write (100:1)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
