      "versionNonce": 462266790,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761016126356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Lock specific ticket row for first user\nex: SELECT FOR UPDATE in postgres\n\nUnlocking??\n- If user purchased, transaction is committed\nand database lock is released.\n- If user takes too long or abandons the purchase,\nwe have to rely on something like session timeouts\nto release the lock (Risk of tickets being locked\nindefinitely).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Lock specific ticket row for first user\nex: SELECT FOR UPDATE in postgres\n\nUnlocking??\n- If user purchased, transaction is committed\nand database lock is released.\n- If user takes too long or abandons the purchase,\nwe have to rely on something like session timeouts\nto release the lock (Risk of tickets being locked\nindefinitely).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
