      "updated": 1761016126356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Keeping transaction open for long time (ex. 10 min lock duration) not good\n- Lock timeouts need to be handled at application level adding additional\ncomplexity.\n- Does not scale well, increases wait times for other users and potential\nperformance bottlenecks.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Keeping transaction open for long time (ex. 10 min lock duration) not good\n- Lock timeouts need to be handled at application level adding additional\ncomplexity.\n- Does not scale well, increases wait times for other users and potential\nperformance bottlenecks.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
