      "text": "Distributed Lock\nwith TTL(Redis)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Distributed Lock\nwith TTL(Redis)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QMBz1rp5fdlLE4758KY6E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25952.189856327666,
      "y": -423.5329394605335,
      "width": 404.7994384765625,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "u_rjcBTL96QDMte5kZxOJ"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bcw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1789442662,
      "version": 1275,
      "versionNonce": 376999014,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761016126356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When user selects ticket, acquire\nlock in redis <ticket_id>:<user_id> with\nTTL 10 min.\n- If user completes purchase, ticket status\nchanged to booked in DB and manually remove\nthe lock from redis by application code\n- If TTL expires, redis automatically releases\nthe lock.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- When user selects ticket, acquire\nlock in redis <ticket_id>:<user_id> with\nTTL 10 min.\n- If user completes purchase, ticket status\nchanged to booked in DB and manually remove\nthe lock from redis by application code\n- If TTL expires, redis automatically releases\nthe lock.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vSoHvYAwzV1E5Hth4bMOs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25884.64303301171,
      "y": -163.944477206329,
      "width": 489.9355163574219,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "pim5KuTeDsx1aAXffpF5X",
        "u_rjcBTL96QDMte5kZxOJ"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bcz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1262341158,
      "version": 2337,
      "versionNonce": 632688550,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761016126356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Reliability on Redis\n- Rare, users might get an error after filling out their payment\ndetails if someone beats them to it.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Reliability on Redis\n- Rare, users might get an error after filling out their payment\ndetails if someone beats them to it.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
