    {
      "id": "cTpEXZzvASOXBb3GuCP3G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23801.57511833914,
      "y": 1886.9278817895884,
      "width": 598.399169921875,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 288543482,
      "version": 726,
      "versionNonce": 1290377254,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761019709854,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Caching\n    - cache event details which have high read rates and\n      low update frequency to minimize load on DB\n      ex: eventId:eventObjet\n    - Read through cache strategy\n    - Cache invalidation and consistency : setting up database\n      triggers to notify caching systems on updates in event table\n      and implementing TTL policy for cache entries. TTLs for \n      static data like venue info and so on can be long.\n\n- Load Balancing\n    - Using Round Robin or Least Connections for even traffic \n      distribution across server instances.\n\n- Horizontal Scaling\n    - Event service is stateless so easily we can add more instances",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Caching\n    - cache event details which have high read rates and\n      low update frequency to minimize load on DB\n      ex: eventId:eventObjet\n    - Read through cache strategy\n    - Cache invalidation and consistency : setting up database\n      triggers to notify caching systems on updates in event table\n      and implementing TTL policy for cache entries. TTLs for \n      static data like venue info and so on can be long.\n\n- Load Balancing\n    - Using Round Robin or Least Connections for even traffic \n      distribution across server instances.\n\n- Horizontal Scaling\n    - Event service is stateless so easily we can add more instances",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
