      "updated": 1761023083929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- node query caching is an LRU cache shared\nby all shards on node, caching results of \nqueries.\n- additionally, shard-level request cache is\nused for caching search responses consisting\nof aggregation\n- can use AWS Cloudfront for edge caching, it only\nmakes sense if results are same for all users.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- node query caching is an LRU cache shared\nby all shards on node, caching results of \nqueries.\n- additionally, shard-level request cache is\nused for caching search responses consisting\nof aggregation\n- can use AWS Cloudfront for edge caching, it only\nmakes sense if results are same for all users.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
