      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761033500609,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- same as above:\n    - first get all users who a given user is following.\n    - next get all of the posts from those users that are older than the input timestamp\n    - finally sort all those posts by time and return to user.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
