      "updated": 1761043886601,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Normal account posts, async worker precomputes feeds for all followers.\n- Mega account posts, async worker skips precomputation\n- Follower X of mega account opens app:\n    - Precomputed feed from table\n    - Latest posts from mega account (via query)\n    - Merges and sorts them for display.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Normal account posts, async worker precomputes feeds for all followers.\n- Mega account posts, async worker skips precomputation\n- Follower X of mega account opens app:\n    - Precomputed feed from table\n    - Latest posts from mega account (via query)\n    - Merges and sorts them for display.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
