      "text": "- we can choose to have multiple distinct caches,\nusing multiple instances servicing the same postID.\n- Though now instead of 1 single database query, N \nqueries can hit the database which is very negligible\nwhen compared to millions of requests",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- we can choose to have multiple distinct caches,\nusing multiple instances servicing the same postID.\n- Though now instead of 1 single database query, N \nqueries can hit the database which is very negligible\nwhen compared to millions of requests",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
