      "text": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "fontSize": 24.355716954353895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RQE9luTSq3GlKHCnvu1pG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35012.767288406074,
      "y": -5559.9506418937735,
      "width": 768.0194091796875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "euCvf2aXIOodYvqBmQuwP"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "boV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1635613377,
      "version": 2199,
      "versionNonce": 1125212289,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761628937514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional :\n- Identify clients by user id, ip, api key\n- Limit requests based on configurable rules (so no code deployment is needed)\n- Return proper error code and meaningful ratelimit headers\n- Analytics on rate limiting data\n- Long term persistence of data\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional :\n- Identify clients by user id, ip, api key\n- Limit requests based on configurable rules (so no code deployment is needed)\n- Return proper error code and meaningful ratelimit headers\n- Analytics on rate limiting data\n- Long term persistence of data\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LjuYD5hDnkGD9UA5eojRA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35015.92779080201,
      "y": -5327.549309581412,
      "width": 267.27978515625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "l6OEuoy0Fx8Yw3zmtpgYL"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "boW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1013086881,
      "version": 2071,
      "versionNonce": 340042657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761629007882,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional :\n- minimal latency in < 10ms\n- availability >> consistency\n- handle 1M req/s\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- minimal latency in < 10ms\n- availability >> consistency\n- handle 1M req/s\n",
      "autoResize": true,
