      "seed": 419256129,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 802376047,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761629857297,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- But each server will only know about its own traffic, not global picture.\n- Only legit when we have single server",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- But each server will only know about its own traffic, not global picture.\n- Only legit when we have single server",
