    },
    {
      "id": "csnV2riTt-g580Ll1Zfpj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 36823.3114963372,
      "y": -1432.4077750324361,
      "width": 448.79937744140625,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8035553,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1541841185,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761644014200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Handles both sustained load and temporary bursts.\n- Just track (tokens, last_refill_time) per client.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Handles both sustained load and temporary bursts.\n- Just track (tokens, last_refill_time) per client.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Z--7rK0UY2Ni2a6J8xU29",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 36831.364461169054,
      "y": -1339.5368540630684,
      "width": 448.79937744140625,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 45583585,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 816937313,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761644146343,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- choosing right bucket size and refill rate has to\nbe choosen strategically\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- choosing right bucket size and refill rate has to\nbe choosen strategically\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FsaR7XKkzeM9pqbcJkEb_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 36837.9082730775,
      "y": -1243.7929465303273,
      "width": 615.9991455078125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 69929807,
      "version": 855,
      "versionNonce": 1800426607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761644568642,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Where do we actually store this??\n- Redis\n\nFlow:\n- A request to gateway with userID: abc\n- Gateway calls redis: HMGET abc:bucket tokens last_refill\n- Gateway checks last_refill time (ex: 30 seconds ago) and \nassume refill_rate is 1/s, it updates tokens count to 30\n- Redis command looks something like this : \nMULTI\nHSET abc:bucket tokens <new_token_count>\nHSET abc:bucket las_refill <current_timestamp>\nEXPIRE abc:bucket 3600\nEXEC\n- Gateway allows/denies the request based on token count and\nupdate it.\n\n- To address race condition while reading as well, we need to move\nthe entire read-calculate-update logic to single atomic operation (Lua\nscripting).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Where do we actually store this??\n- Redis\n\nFlow:\n- A request to gateway with userID: abc\n- Gateway calls redis: HMGET abc:bucket tokens last_refill\n- Gateway checks last_refill time (ex: 30 seconds ago) and \nassume refill_rate is 1/s, it updates tokens count to 30\n- Redis command looks something like this : \nMULTI\nHSET abc:bucket tokens <new_token_count>\nHSET abc:bucket las_refill <current_timestamp>\nEXPIRE abc:bucket 3600\nEXEC\n- Gateway allows/denies the request based on token count and\nupdate it.\n\n- To address race condition while reading as well, we need to move\nthe entire read-calculate-update logic to single atomic operation (Lua\nscripting).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RGo4wXhAxCfBRmTMX_TGX",
