      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- availability >> consistency\n- execute jobs within 2s of their scheduled time\n- handle 10k jobs/s\n- At least once execution\n",
