      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761663041324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- For each 5 minute window - need to process 3M jobs (10,000 jobs/second * 300 seconds).\n- SQS Messages can be upto 256KB in size, our message is just around 200 bytes each\n(job_id, execution_time, some_metadata) -> 3M * 200 = 600 MB.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- For each 5 minute window - need to process 3M jobs (10,000 jobs/second * 300 seconds).\n- SQS Messages can be upto 256KB in size, our message is just around 200 bytes each\n(job_id, execution_time, some_metadata) -> 3M * 200 = 600 MB.\n",
