      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761664180407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Distributed Locking mechanism using\ndatabase to track ownership of jobs\n- Ex: Worker A wants to process job 123,\nit updates the database Job 123 is leased\nto Worker A until 10:30:15 and so on",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Distributed Locking mechanism using\ndatabase to track ownership of jobs\n- Ex: Worker A wants to process job 123,\nit updates the database Job 123 is leased\nto Worker A until 10:30:15 and so on",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
