      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "fontSize": 24.355716954353895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jbfSxyzzWgPEMl1yBTnGD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47945.64290903912,
      "y": -5655.646643475323,
      "width": 733.639404296875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ccP4mf5zVFQekhqAA9_w-"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "byy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1352848431,
      "version": 2863,
      "versionNonce": 695891137,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761702801749,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional :\n- Users can click on an ad and be redirected to advertiser's website\n- Advertisers can query click metrics over time with 1 minute min granularity\n(good to have)\n- Ad targeting and Ad serving\n- Cross device tracking\n- Integration with offline marketing channels\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional :\n- Users can click on an ad and be redirected to advertiser's website\n- Advertisers can query click metrics over time with 1 minute min granularity\n(good to have)\n- Ad targeting and Ad serving\n- Cross device tracking\n- Integration with offline marketing channels\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "40RL3QPuwy4ldNFa4RoMy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47947.89186045604,
      "y": -5424.118532112394,
      "width": 505.69964599609375,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "6FIzhgQM6twffWxB644VY"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "byz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1555461711,
      "version": 2665,
      "versionNonce": 1080020847,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761713113126,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional :\n- Handle peak 10k CPS\n- low latency analytics queries < 1s\n- Fault tolerance and should not lose any click data\n- As realtime as possible.\n- Idempotent click tracking\n(good to have)\n- spam detection\n- demographic profiling of users\n- Conversion tracking\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- Handle peak 10k CPS\n- low latency analytics queries < 1s\n- Fault tolerance and should not lose any click data\n- As realtime as possible.\n- Idempotent click tracking\n(good to have)\n- spam detection\n- demographic profiling of users\n- Conversion tracking\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
