      "versionNonce": 485624271,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761711317654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Both kinesis and Flink partition by AdId with\n(Ex: AdId:0-N) to handle celebrity solution for\nhot shards\n- 7 days retention period on kinesis\n- Checkpointing on Flink - Periodically write its state\nto persistent storage like s3 (if aggregation windows are \nlong ex: a week)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Both kinesis and Flink partition by AdId with\n(Ex: AdId:0-N) to handle celebrity solution for\nhot shards\n- 7 days retention period on kinesis\n- Checkpointing on Flink - Periodically write its state\nto persistent storage like s3 (if aggregation windows are \nlong ex: a week)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
