      "text": "- Ad Placement service generates a \nunique impression ID for each ad instance\nand now this will be sent to browser\nalong with click data.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Ad Placement service generates a \nunique impression ID for each ad instance\nand now this will be sent to browser\nalong with click data.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ghDloAznDlUc_6kyFrTEj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48797.70644501888,
      "y": 6528.886364155559,
      "width": 759,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c04D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1585993953,
      "version": 627,
      "versionNonce": 48327297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761713028046,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow\n- Ad placement service generates a unique impression ID\nfor each ad instance shown to the user.\n- The impression ID is signed with a secret ket and sent\nto the browser along with the ad.\n- When the user clicks on the ad, the browser sends the\nimpression ID along with click data.\n- The click processor verifies the signature of impression\nID.\n- The click processor checks if the impression ID exists in a cache.\nIf it does, then its a duplicate and we ignore it, else put in stream\nand cache the Impression ID.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow\n- Ad placement service generates a unique impression ID\nfor each ad instance shown to the user.\n- The impression ID is signed with a secret ket and sent\nto the browser along with the ad.\n- When the user clicks on the ad, the browser sends the\nimpression ID along with click data.\n- The click processor verifies the signature of impression\nID.\n- The click processor checks if the impression ID exists in a cache.\nIf it does, then its a duplicate and we ignore it, else put in stream\nand cache the Impression ID.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2HqmHhXPG4iE9pClP48jC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48812.46819954985,
      "y": 6868.202091884598,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c04E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 623714351,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 328417807,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761713093216,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis : if 100M clicks per day * 16 bytes = 1.6 GB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis : if 100M clicks per day * 16 bytes = 1.6 GB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zUe5mHZ8olLavoaaq6T51",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47988.43550881573,
      "y": 7113.985732085623,
      "width": 418,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
