      "updated": 1761716157191,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "fontSize": 24.355716954353895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZwssKWJBRdKFpbXkLor66",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57056.04782491751,
      "y": -6062.320994157124,
      "width": 801.3394775390625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eSHX2S0PIIWPVEdwQE18p"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c05D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 737237199,
      "version": 3286,
      "versionNonce": 1637377121,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761716435089,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional :\n- Crawl the web starting from a given set of seed URLs.\n- Extract text data from each web page and store the text for later processing.\n(good to have)\n- Actual processing of text data.\n- Handling non text-data (ex: images, videos, etc)\n- Handling dynamic content (ex: javascript rendered pages)\n- Handling login-required pages\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional :\n- Crawl the web starting from a given set of seed URLs.\n- Extract text data from each web page and store the text for later processing.\n(good to have)\n- Actual processing of text data.\n- Handling non text-data (ex: images, videos, etc)\n- Handling dynamic content (ex: javascript rendered pages)\n- Handling login-required pages\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dPVYQ_jynAl7BnXRIWXVD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57057.958715891684,
      "y": -5830.8753116947955,
      "width": 594.9196166992188,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "dRvXdxudBZaOZ0vGxzjL_"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c05E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 554395375,
      "version": 3089,
      "versionNonce": 1391041345,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761717829757,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional :\n- Fault tolerance and resume crawling without losing progress\n- Respect robots.txt and not overload website servers\n- Scale to handle 10B pages\n- Efficient to crawl 10B pages in 5 days.\n(good to have)\n- Security to protect from malicious actors\n- Cost to operate within budget constraints\n- Adhering to compliance - respecting privacy regulations.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- Fault tolerance and resume crawling without losing progress\n- Respect robots.txt and not overload website servers\n- Scale to handle 10B pages\n- Efficient to crawl 10B pages in 5 days.\n(good to have)\n- Security to protect from malicious actors\n- Cost to operate within budget constraints\n- Adhering to compliance - respecting privacy regulations.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
