      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761720789659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- robots.txt : is a file that websites use to communicate with web crawlers.\nIt tells crawlers which pages they are allowed to crawl and which pages they are not.\nIt also tells crawlers how frequently they can crawl the site.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- robots.txt : is a file that websites use to communicate with web crawlers.\nIt tells crawlers which pages they are allowed to crawl and which pages they are not.\nIt also tells crawlers how frequently they can crawl the site.",
