    {
      "id": "f99s8e_RFMYk_PWxXLnTm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57127.977429449216,
      "y": 2691.723516069963,
      "width": 836,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c090",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 935505135,
      "version": 550,
      "versionNonce": 257995183,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761721614532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow\n1. Fetch the robots.txt file for the domain\n2. Parse the robots.txt file and store in metadata DB\n3. When we pull a URL off the queue, check the rules stored\nin the metadataDB for that domain.\n4. If the URL is disallowed, ack the message and move on to the next URL\n5. If the URL is allowed, check the Crawl-delay directive\n6. If the Crawl-delay has not passed put it back on queue using DelaySeconds\n7. If passed, crawl the page and update the lastCrawlTime for domain",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow\n1. Fetch the robots.txt file for the domain\n2. Parse the robots.txt file and store in metadata DB\n3. When we pull a URL off the queue, check the rules stored\nin the metadataDB for that domain.\n4. If the URL is disallowed, ack the message and move on to the next URL\n5. If the URL is allowed, check the Crawl-delay directive\n6. If the Crawl-delay has not passed put it back on queue using DelaySeconds\n7. If passed, crawl the page and update the lastCrawlTime for domain",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wv8dhmR0YSrL46oLWnTlx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57126.12314610035,
      "y": 2980.9741423431797,
      "width": 836,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c091",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 294356129,
      "version": 197,
      "versionNonce": 1296033793,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761721812520,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rate Limiting\n- Use Redis (sliding window algo to track req counts per domain per second)\n- To address synchronized behavior use jitter(introduce random delay to each\ncrawler's request)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rate Limiting\n- Use Redis (sliding window algo to track req counts per domain per second)\n- To address synchronized behavior use jitter(introduce random delay to each\ncrawler's request)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "02gyPFnEMDpVLTE_6zch7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57079.303334494136,
      "y": 3341.413585350913,
      "width": 803,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c092",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 136273793,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 1825352225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761722166350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5.3 Scale to handle 10B pages and Efficient to crawl 10B pages in 5 days.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5.3 Scale to handle 10B pages and Efficient to crawl 10B pages in 5 days.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EHk5rOZ4-evzGDkYw5WN3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57152.909191821884,
      "y": 3446.983669738902,
      "width": 968,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c093",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1987007969,
      "version": 543,
      "versionNonce": 1987163425,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761722432317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Assuming avg. size of page size is 2MB\n- Typical AWS network optimized instance can handle about 400 Gbps or 50 GB/s throughput\n- 2MB pages how many -> 50,000 MB/s / 2 MB -> 25,000 pages/second\n- considering 30% utilization of that bandwidth : 25,000 * 30% = 7500 pages/second\n\n7500 pages -> 1 second\n10,000,000,000 oages -> ?? ~ 1,333,333 seconds = 15.4 days (one machine)\n\n- To achieve in 5 days, we might need 4 machines : 15.4/4 ~3.85 days",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Assuming avg. size of page size is 2MB\n- Typical AWS network optimized instance can handle about 400 Gbps or 50 GB/s throughput\n- 2MB pages how many -> 50,000 MB/s / 2 MB -> 25,000 pages/second\n- considering 30% utilization of that bandwidth : 25,000 * 30% = 7500 pages/second\n\n7500 pages -> 1 second\n10,000,000,000 oages -> ?? ~ 1,333,333 seconds = 15.4 days (one machine)\n\n- To achieve in 5 days, we might need 4 machines : 15.4/4 ~3.85 days",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rd5DfX4raL9LpYT9KORRN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57111.36797196428,
      "y": 3753.116183752012,
      "width": 825,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
