      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Current Problem (Assuming both persons swipe at the same time)\n- Person A swipe hits the server and we check for inverse swipe -> Nothing.\n- Person B swipe hits the server and we check for inverse swipe -> Nothing.\n- We save Person A swipe on Person B.\n- We save Person B swipe on Person A.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Current Problem (Assuming both persons swipe at the same time)\n- Person A swipe hits the server and we check for inverse swipe -> Nothing.\n- Person B swipe hits the server and we check for inverse swipe -> Nothing.\n- We save Person A swipe on Person B.\n- We save Person B swipe on Person A.",
