      "updated": 1761806195676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The API server will receive the user's code submission and problem ID and send it\nto appropriate container for language specified\n2. The isolated container runs the user's code in sandboxed environment and returns\nthe result to the API server.\n3. The API Server will then store the submission results in database and return the results \nto the client",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The API server will receive the user's code submission and problem ID and send it\nto appropriate container for language specified\n2. The isolated container runs the user's code in sandboxed environment and returns\nthe result to the API server.\n3. The API Server will then store the submission results in database and return the results \nto the client",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
