      "updated": 1761808266948,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Security\n- Docker for isolation\n- Read only filesystem (writes to tmp)\n- CPU and Memory bounds\n- Explicit timeout per execution\n- VPC for network controls\n- No system calls (seccomp)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Security\n- Docker for isolation\n- Read only filesystem (writes to tmp)\n- CPU and Memory bounds\n- Explicit timeout per execution\n- VPC for network controls\n- No system calls (seccomp)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
