      "updated": 1761807970252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Assume 10k submission at a time, 100 test cases\nfor each submission,each test case maybe takes\n100ms to run\n- so each submission -> 100 * 100ms = 10s\n- 10k submissions -> 1M test cases -> 100,000 seconds\n-> ~27hours (1667 CPU cores to run) - load in one min\n- Powerful AWS instance have only 128 cores",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Assume 10k submission at a time, 100 test cases\nfor each submission,each test case maybe takes\n100ms to run\n- so each submission -> 100 * 100ms = 10s\n- 10k submissions -> 1M test cases -> 100,000 seconds\n-> ~27hours (1667 CPU cores to run) - load in one min\n- Powerful AWS instance have only 128 cores",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
