      "seed": 2099438382,
      "version": 324,
      "versionNonce": 223094062,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762663659583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 2PC (Distributed transactions) for atomicity\nacross redis and database\n- Accept Redis as single source of truth\n- Optimistic concurrency with retry logic: update\ncache atomically first then write to the database.\nIf database write fails, roll back the cache update.",
