    {
      "id": "0FiGw0nPYMr4Wk2A7Ot1D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81220.33039642792,
      "y": -251.80904562930755,
      "width": 814,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0RL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1219157810,
      "version": 395,
      "versionNonce": 688249650,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762664216576,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OCC (Optimistic Concurrency Control)\n1. Read the auction row and get the current max bid\n2. Validate that the new bid is higher than the max bid\n3. Try to update auction row, but only if the max bid hasn't changed:\n    UPDATE auctions \n    SET max_bid = :new_bid \n    WHERE id = :auction_id AND max_bid = :original_max_bid\n4. If update succeeds, write the bid record. If it fails retry from step 1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OCC (Optimistic Concurrency Control)\n1. Read the auction row and get the current max bid\n2. Validate that the new bid is higher than the max bid\n3. Try to update auction row, but only if the max bid hasn't changed:\n    UPDATE auctions \n    SET max_bid = :new_bid \n    WHERE id = :auction_id AND max_bid = :original_max_bid\n4. If update succeeds, write the bid record. If it fails retry from step 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0ym0BjJYqha0yoqfmjxX7",
