      "versionNonce": 675799726,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762690338515,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.1 Retrieve historical price data\n\nGET /products/{product_id}/price?period=30d&granularity=daily -> PriceHistory[]\n\n\n3.2 Subscribe to price drop notifications\n\nPOST /subscriptions\n{\n    product_id,\n    price_threshold,\n    notification_type\n} -> 200\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20.584857219536815,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.1 Retrieve historical price data\n\nGET /products/{product_id}/price?period=30d&granularity=daily -> PriceHistory[]\n\n\n3.2 Subscribe to price drop notifications\n\nPOST /subscriptions\n{\n    product_id,\n    price_threshold,\n    notification_type\n} -> 200\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
