      "text": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "fontSize": 24.355716954353895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ii5IwAKAdD2k8s5yNZj6V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 101736.8140052608,
      "y": -8696.007793844443,
      "width": 759.5194702148438,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "LhMc6lUGifxmLtQ6liESI"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0ef",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1422359154,
      "version": 4082,
      "versionNonce": 1246770261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762827182242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional :\n- should be able to start, pause, stop and save their runs and rides.\n- while running or cycling, should be able to view activity data, including route,\ndistance and time.\n- should be able to view details about self and friends\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional :\n- should be able to start, pause, stop and save their runs and rides.\n- while running or cycling, should be able to view activity data, including route,\ndistance and time.\n- should be able to view details about self and friends\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kXzj4RGmTNqFstcfjeOxc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 101739.07170169485,
      "y": -8463.580351398898,
      "width": 584.9396362304688,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "D2-Q_gDam6w07Ar9mjZjF"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0eg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1519606834,
      "version": 3353,
      "versionNonce": 1322157947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762826166638,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional :\n- availability >>> consistency.\n- function in remote areas with no/low network connectivity\n- up to date local activity stats (very low latency)\n- handle 10M concurrent activities\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- availability >>> consistency.\n- function in remote areas with no/low network connectivity\n- up to date local activity stats (very low latency)\n- handle 10M concurrent activities\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
