      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762829078172,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5.2 handle 10M concurrent activities",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5.2 handle 10M concurrent activities",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vWzhZLf_hdr03PfxmY4I3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 101827.7067776633,
      "y": -2887.0131131349663,
      "width": 1177,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0g9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1972291669,
      "version": 547,
      "versionNonce": 1633365979,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762829507569,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Assuming 100M DAU -> 100M new activities/day -> 36500M or 36.5B activities\n- Storage: 100Bytes/activity, Route: average 30m and GPS coordinates every 3 seconds\n    -> 1800/3 -> 600 points/activity (8bytes + 8bytes + 8bytes) * 600 ~15KB\n    15KB * 36.5B = 547.5TB of data each year\n\n- Shard by the time that activity was completed\n- Data tiers: Hot data(recent ones) in redis, warm data(2-12months old) postgres, cold data(>1 year old) s3",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Assuming 100M DAU -> 100M new activities/day -> 36500M or 36.5B activities\n- Storage: 100Bytes/activity, Route: average 30m and GPS coordinates every 3 seconds\n    -> 1800/3 -> 600 points/activity (8bytes + 8bytes + 8bytes) * 600 ~15KB\n    15KB * 36.5B = 547.5TB of data each year\n\n- Shard by the time that activity was completed\n- Data tiers: Hot data(recent ones) in redis, warm data(2-12months old) postgres, cold data(>1 year old) s3",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
