      "updated": 1763090000369,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User sends a sendMessage message to chat server\n2. Chat server looks up all participants in chat via ChatParticipant table\n3. Chat server looks up websocket connection for each participant in its\ninternal hash table and sends message via each connection",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User sends a sendMessage message to chat server\n2. Chat server looks up all participants in chat via ChatParticipant table\n3. Chat server looks up websocket connection for each participant in its\ninternal hash table and sends message via each connection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
