      "updated": 1763168930004,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "fontSize": 24.355716954353895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Requirements\n    \n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aCYx9wPCE_nC103DezeRL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145822.43112668,
      "y": -10462.062145104186,
      "width": 682.779541015625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "fnOL1RWpfGVmyQ77em8xG",
        "mjJ_OQGF-QU69YWdf9xNa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0zB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1489275846,
      "version": 5025,
      "versionNonce": 1474727750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763170300159,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional :\n- should be able to create and like posts\n- should be able to search posts by keyword\n- should be able to get search results sorted by recency or like count",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional :\n- should be able to create and like posts\n- should be able to search posts by keyword\n- should be able to get search results sorted by recency or like count",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8n7zATGgATSnT6MCA8aJl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145824.46874972488,
      "y": -10229.917415013724,
      "width": 437.7596740722656,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "bnBTFdbkNjd9voTB2Dg-8",
        "mjJ_OQGF-QU69YWdf9xNa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0zC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1896555270,
      "version": 4168,
      "versionNonce": 545962118,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763174771319,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional :\n- Fast, queries (< 500ms)\n- handle high volume of requests\n- New posts must be searchable in < 1 minute\n- All posts must be available\n- Optimize storage\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional :\n- Fast, queries (< 500ms)\n- handle high volume of requests\n- New posts must be searchable in < 1 minute\n- All posts must be available\n- Optimize storage\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9KYRGQfs1YwbGNhZmwmBP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145815.2845460031,
      "y": -10023.100570177807,
      "width": 949.746826171875,
      "height": 426.22504670119315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "SRQ0ZEyw7o9qLCSUQQmI-",
        "mjJ_OQGF-QU69YWdf9xNa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0zD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1258082886,
      "version": 2156,
      "versionNonce": 291213510,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763169007504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scale Estimations\n\nAssuming 1B users\n\nFor Write Volumes:\n    - Posts Created: 1B * 1 post/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k posts/second\n    - Likes Created: 1B * 10 likes/day / (100k seconds/day) = 100k likes/second\n\nFor Read Volumes:\n    - Searches: 1B * 1 search/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k Searches/second\n\nStorage Estimates: Assuming it is 10 year old system\n    - Posts searchable: 1B posts/day * 365 days/year * 10 years = 3.6T posts\n    - Raw Size: 3.6T posts * 1kb/post = 3.6 PB",
      "fontSize": 24.355716954353895,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scale Estimations\n\nAssuming 1B users\n\nFor Write Volumes:\n    - Posts Created: 1B * 1 post/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k posts/second\n    - Likes Created: 1B * 10 likes/day / (100k seconds/day) = 100k likes/second\n\nFor Read Volumes:\n    - Searches: 1B * 1 search/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k Searches/second\n\nStorage Estimates: Assuming it is 10 year old system\n    - Posts searchable: 1B posts/day * 365 days/year * 10 years = 3.6T posts\n    - Raw Size: 3.6T posts * 1kb/post = 3.6 PB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_VnAqJgxPDm6VU77D9VrW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145825.69018263425,
      "y": -9474.19270436687,
      "width": 246.39990234375,
      "height": 175,
